+# framework overlays built by scripts/make-overlays.sh with the storage, installd, power, sysrq, weaver, biometric, gatekeeper, pdb, apexd, appid15000, nousers, nativeservices, wipesecrets and ksuappid guards, and the secims carve-out (com.sec.imsservice kept in android.uid.system from /system_ext/priv-app/OneOSSecIms only)
+# HyperOS: miui-services_patched.jar and apprecovery.proinstaller_patched.jar (patches/miui_guards.py)
+# HyperOS: framework_patched.jar (patches/hyperos_framework.py, CameraStatus as One UI's cameraserver writes it; 0.4.31: and One UI's camera transaction codes, patches/pixel_camera_abi.py)
+# HyperOS: miui-wifi-service_patched.jar (patches/hyperos_hal_ext.py, Xiaomi's HAL extension casts only on Xiaomi's)
+# HyperOS: miui-telephony-common_patched.jar (patches/hyperos_telephony.py, the IMS controller without an IMS phone)
+# telephony-common_patched.jar: the SMS service centre as an international number (patches/guest_smsc_international.py); SEND_SMS error 66 (sent, no result payload) counted as sent (patches/guest_sms_invalid_response.py)
+# libcamera_client_patched.so, libcameracompatbilityinfo_patched.so: the native camera client with One UI's codes (patches/pixel_camera_native.py)
+# libsurfaceflinger_patched.so: Xiaomi's SurfaceFlinger with the display mode group read 32-bit (patches/hyperos_sf_group.py; 11-19 A36: abort at the first display, 'No matching frame rate modes')
+# biometric-remove guard: services_patched.jar never removes a fingerprint or face template (patches/guest_no_biometric_remove.py); the fingerprint sensor through AIDL (patches/guest_force_aidl_fingerprint.py, from pull request #152); HyperOS Global hk r2; Samsung's touch request and the touch watcher for the optical sensor (patches/guest_seh_touch.py, guest_fp_touchwatch.py)
+# miui-framework_patched.jar: DisplayFeatureManager a no-op without Xiaomi's displayfeature service (patches/hyperos_displayfeature_stub.py, vdcoolok); hk r2
+# guest vold name: gvld (vold_patched, service.incremental_patched.so and services_patched.jar)
